11. In view of the above, the application is allowed in the following terms:
(i) In the event the applicant is arrested in connection with FIR No.0374 of 2024 dated 05.06.2024 registered at Ambad Police Station, District Nashik City, he shall be released on bail on furnishing PR Bond of  50,000/- (Rupees Fifty Thousand only) and one or two sureties in the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court;
